<title>USA: Sun Co up sharply after Q2 earnings.</title>
<headline>Sun Co up sharply after Q2 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The share price of refiner Sun Co surged 1-3/4 to 32-7/8 after the company reported second quarter operating earnings of $1.07, up from $0.50 a year ago.</p>
<p>Analysts had been looking for $0.77 per share, according to investment network First Call.</p>
<p>Tosco Corp earnings were in line with analyst forecasts of $0.43 per share, up from $0.41 a year ago.</p>
